                              *Shareware*

    Welcome to Vote!  Skypoll was a great program, but it kept giving me
  continual problems whenever I would try to delete a poll.  So, after
  numerous complaints from users I decided to write vote.

    It's a lot like Skypoll, but much safer and it has a few plusses
  that I wanted.  What are those plusses?

        *  Neat ANSI and SKYPIX stuff.

        *  3 Modes of Swear Checking
            - mode 0: No checking.
            - mode 1: TV Style Swearing Allowed.
            - mode 2: Absolutely *NO* swearing.

        *  Stupidity Barrier.

        *  Insult Barrier.

        *  Sysop/CoSysop functioons, regarding deleting polls and making
           polls.

        *  No Comment/No Good Answer option toggleable.  {SEE BELOW}

        *  MakePoll option for users toggleable.

        *  Anonymous poll-posting option (and the sysop can toggle if he
           wants to see who really posted it or not, if so the poster's
           name will be followed with an "{A}" if they posted anonymously.)

        *  Toggle On/Off Intro Screen.

    And some other cool stuff.  I am working on a Skypoll > Vote poll
  converter but it's just not agreeing with me.  I'll see what I can do.

                                -+-

    This program is SHAREWARE.  If you use this program and can afford to
    do it PLEASE send me $5.

                        David Cole
                        620 Airport Access - Apt. 3
                        Traverse City, MI  49684

    If you register it, I will send you a registered version with an option
    to limit the number of polls posted, with an option either to delete
    the oldest polls, stop people from posting anymore, or just completely
    erase the polls.

    I understand these are hard economic times, but that is precisely why
    I'm asking for this.  If you truely cannot afford it, and you have no
    users that wish to contribute, then don't worry about it.  But if
    I don't start making a little money off of this hobby the BBS may go
    under and then *BAM!* no more programs!

                                -+-

    HOW TO INSTALL????
    ---------------------------------------------------------------------
    1.  Copy "THISISIT.LHA" to JMP:

    2.  Uncompress it, it will open up it's own directories and install
        itself where it pleases.

    3.  Add the option SOMEWHERE in your menus to load "JMP:Vote.rexx".

    4.  Tell your users about it!
    ---------------------------------------------------------------------

        Well thanks!  And for further updates call my BBS, Wolverine's Den,
     (616)922-0987, or look in the internet on
            ab20.larc.nasa.gov
            /incoming/amiga/Skyline/
     for my files!

        This is the Skyline 1.3x version.  If needed I will make a Skyline
     2.0 version when I get it.


    ---------------------------------------------------------------------

    IMPORTANT NOTES:

        1.  You may not edit either Vote.rexx or VoteNotice.rexx in any
            way, other than the CONFIGURABLES section of both programs.
            *BE SURE TO EDIT THEM TO YOUR LIKING!*

        2.  Be careful with the "nocomment" flag.  If you change it while
            there are already polls made, Vote will flip out and mess up
            ROYALLY.  SO, if you ever change that option, you must delete
            the old polls.

            You can delete the polls COMPLETELY doing this:

                cd JMP:Vote
                delete TOPPOLL
                delete Polls/#?
                delete #?.DAT

            That will totally reset the Voting Booth.  The delete option
            inside the program is only for deleting selectively.  So if you
            wish to do a total reset, type the commands above.
